@startuml
title Odysseus - Application Layer

left to right direction
hide empty description

skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam roundcorner 18
skinparam ArrowColor #64748B
skinparam ArrowThickness 2
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam defaultFontSize 13
skinparam defaultFontColor #0F172A
skinparam TitleFontColor #0F172A

skinparam rectangle {
    BorderColor #CBD5E1
    FontColor #0F172A
}

skinparam package {
    BorderColor #94A3B8
    FontColor #334155
}

skinparam note {
    BackgroundColor #FFFDE7
    BorderColor #D6B656
    FontColor #334155
}


rectangle "<b>WEB ROUTE</b>\n<i>driving adapter</i>\n\nCalls application operations" as Web #E0F2FE

package "application/" #F0FDFA {
    rectangle "<b>availability.py</b>\n\nTrainingAvailabilityUseCases\n\n__init__(store)\nget_recurring_availability()\nupdate_recurring_availability(availability)" as UseCases #D1FAE5

    rectangle "<b>contracts.py</b>\n\nTrainingAvailabilityStore\n<i>Protocol</i>\n\nload(): RecurringTrainingAvailability\nsave(availability): None" as Contract #CCFBF1

    rectangle "<b>goals_and_events.py</b>\n\nGoalsAndEventsUseCases\n\n__init__(store)\nget_future_planning_targets(as_of: date): FuturePlanningTargets\nlist_goals(): tuple[Goal, ...]\nget_goal(goal_id): Goal\ncreate_goal(...): Goal\nupdate_goal(goal): None\ndelete_goal(goal_id): None\nlist_target_events(): tuple[TargetEvent, ...]\nget_target_event(event_id): TargetEvent\ncreate_target_event(...): TargetEvent\nupdate_target_event(event): None\ndelete_target_event(event_id): None" as GoalsUseCases #D1FAE5

    rectangle "<b>goals_and_events.py</b>\n\nFuturePlanningTargets\n<i>frozen dataclass</i>\n\ngoals: tuple[Goal, ...]\ntarget_events: tuple[TargetEvent, ...]" as FutureTargets #CCFBF1

    rectangle "<b>contracts.py</b>\n\nGoalsAndEventsStore\n<i>Protocol</i>\n\nload(): GoalsAndEventsSnapshot\nsave(snapshot): None" as GoalsContract #CCFBF1

    rectangle "<b>contracts.py</b>\n\nGoalsAndEventsSnapshot\n<i>frozen dataclass</i>\n\ngoals: tuple[Goal, ...] = ()\ntarget_events: tuple[TargetEvent, ...] = ()" as Snapshot #CCFBF1
}

rectangle "<b>RecurringTrainingAvailability</b>\n<i>domain value</i>" as Domain #EDE9FE
rectangle "<b>CONCRETE STORE OBJECT</b>\n<i>current runtime object:\nInMemoryTrainingAvailabilityStore</i>" as Adapter #FFEDD5
rectangle "<b>Goal and TargetEvent</b>\n<i>domain values</i>\n\nOwn title/name validity\nand explicit status/date fields" as GoalsDomain #EDE9FE

Web --> UseCases : invokes
UseCases --> Contract : source dependency
UseCases --> Domain : accepts / returns
Adapter ..> Contract : structurally satisfies
UseCases --> Adapter : runtime calls injected object
GoalsUseCases --> GoalsContract : loads / saves one replacement snapshot
GoalsContract --> Snapshot : loads / saves
GoalsUseCases --> Snapshot : replaces on mutation
GoalsUseCases --> GoalsDomain : creates / accepts / returns
Snapshot --> GoalsDomain : contains tuples
GoalsUseCases --> FutureTargets : returns read-only selection
FutureTargets --> GoalsDomain : retains original objects / order

note bottom of UseCases
The use case coordinates application behaviour.
Currently GET delegates to load()
and update delegates to save().
end note

note bottom of Contract
The Protocol is a type-level contract.
It is not another runtime object between
the use case and the concrete adapter.
end note

note bottom of Adapter
At runtime the use case holds the concrete object,
while application source is typed against
TrainingAvailabilityStore.
end note

note bottom of GoalsUseCases
Creation assigns UUIDs with uuid4().
Updates accept complete domain values.

Non-None goal event references must exist.
Missing records/references raise LookupError.
ACTIVE goals cannot link to CANCELLED events:
create/update raises ValueError without saving.

update_target_event(CANCELLED) cancels only
ACTIVE linked goals, keeping their other fields.
Event and goal changes use one snapshot save.
Other goal statuses and unrelated goals are unchanged.

Cancelling a goal does not affect its event or peers.
Reactivating an event does not reactivate goals.
COMPLETED/INACTIVE events do not cancel goals.

Deleting a goal leaves its event untouched.
Deleting an event unlinks every linked goal,
preserving all other goal fields.
Removal and unlinking use one snapshot save.

Domain validity is not duplicated here.
Passing dates do not change statuses.
end note

note bottom of GoalsContract
Application-owned synchronous contract.
No goals/events web flow is implemented.
end note

note bottom of FutureTargets
Required explicit as_of date; same-day dates qualify.
One snapshot load; no save or status changes.

ACTIVE goals: undated or target_date >= as_of.
ACTIVE events: event_date >= as_of.
Linked goals additionally require a qualifying event.
Missing/past/non-active events exclude linked goals.

Historical records remain accessible through list/get.
No ranking, recovery windows, or planning algorithm.
end note

@enduml
